        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "You are shepherding PR #852 through CI to merge.\n\nRepository: anchapin/nexus-proxy\nPR: https://github.com/anchapin/nexus-proxy/pull/852\nBranch: fix/issue-844-cascade-slog\nWorkdir: /home/alex/AI/worktrees/issue-844-cascade-slog\n\nSteps:\n1. Check CI status: gh pr checks 852\n2. IF CI is green:\n   a. Check mergeable: gh pr view 852 --json mergeable\n   b. If CONFLICTING → follow the merge conflict protocol below\n   c. If MERGEABLE → merge: gh pr merge 852 --squash --delete-branch\n      Then verify the merge persisted:\n      ```\n      gh pr view 852 --json mergedAt --jq '.mergedAt'\n      ```\n      - If mergedAt is NOT null → merge succeeded, proceed to cleanup\n      - If mergedAt IS null → retry once: `gh pr merge 852 --squash --delete-branch`\n        If second attempt also yields null mergedAt → report BLOCKED and STOP\n   d. Clean up: git worktree remove ../worktrees/issue-844-cascade-slog\n3. IF CI is failing:\n   a. Get failing run: gh run list --branch fix/issue-844-cascade-slog --limit 1\n   b. Get logs: gh run view <RUN_ID> --log\n   c. Diagnose the FIRST failing step\n   d. Apply minimal fix in the worktree\n   e. Commit and push: git add -A && git commit -m \"fix: resolve CI failure\" && git push\n   f. Wait for CI to re-run (poll every 30s, max 10 iterations)\n   g. If still failing after 10 iterations → report blocker and STOP\n4. IF merge conflict detected:\n   a. git fetch origin develop\n   b. git rebase origin/develop\n   c. Resolve conflicts automatically where possible\n   d. If conflicts cannot be auto-resolved → STOP and report conflict details\n   e. git push --force-with-lease origin fix/issue-844-cascade-slog\n   f. Re-trigger CI and return to step 1\n\nReport back: final status (MERGED / BLOCKED / CONFLICT), iterations used, files fixed.",
